# Reference only. The real ads.txt is generated at build time from
# VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT (see scripts/prerender.mjs), so you do not need to
# create one by hand. Just set VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT in keys.env and build.
#
# The generated line looks like this (pub id is your ca-pub-... with the
# leading "ca-" stripped; the trailing token is Google's fixed cert id):
google.com, pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX, DIRECT, f08c47fec0942fa0
